(2099, 'HB324', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 169, 'Sabonete Facial Argila Rosa', 'Compre Sabonete Facial Argila Rosa com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">Sabonete Facial Argila Rosa</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Investindo cada vez mais nos cuidados com a pele, a Ruby Rose desenvolveu uma linha facial completa de Argila Rosa, que &eacute; &oacute;tima para reduzir e controlar a oleosidade, auxiliar na cicatriza&ccedil;&atilde;o, regenera&ccedil;&atilde;o e hidrata&ccedil;&atilde;o da pele, al&eacute;m de possuir a&ccedil;&atilde;o anti-inflamat&oacute;ria.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">O sabonete l&iacute;quido foi desenvolvido para todos os tipos de pele, proporciona uma espuma de limpeza que hidrata e limpa gentilmente, oferecendo conforto e suavidade a pele e deixando-a renovada e com um brilho natural. &Eacute; elaborado com argila rosa, rico em sais minerais, provitamina B5 e fito extratos e possui a&ccedil;&atilde;o antiss&eacute;ptica, revitalizando e hidratante.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Refer&ecirc;ncia:</span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;HB324</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Dimens&atilde;o:</span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;14x3x4</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Frequencia:</span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;Use 2x ao dia</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #f