canto externo.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; width: auto; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Lato, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; outline-style: none !important; outline-width: initial !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Para fazer o gatinho utilize um papel e coloque sob o canto no final dos olhos e alinhe a melhor posi&ccedil;&atilde;o para fazer o gatinho.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; width: auto; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Lato, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; outline-style: none !important; outline-width: initial !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important;\">Precau&ccedil;&otilde;es:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; width: auto; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Lato, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; outline-style: none !important; outline-width: initial !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Uso externo. N&atilde;o aplique sobre a pele irritada ou lesionada. Se houver qualquer sinal de irrita&ccedil;&atilde;o, descontinue o uso do produto. Evite calor excessivo. Mantenha a embalagem bem fechada e fora do alcance de crian&ccedil;as. Feche bem ap&oacute;s cada utiliza&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; width: auto; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Lato, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; outline-style: none !important; outline-width: initial !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important;\">Componentes</strong>: Triethylhexanoin, Paraffin, Glycol Montanate, Synthetic wax, Euphorbia cerifera cera, Caprylic/capric Triglyceride, Polybutene, Bis-Diglyceryl polyacyladipate-2, Talc, Cetyl Palmitate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Parfum, Benzyl Salicylate, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, Linalool</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; width: auto; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Lato, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; outline-style: none !important; outline-width: initial !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Pode conter: Mica, CI 77891, CI 77491, CI 77499, CI 77510, CI 77492, CI 16035, CI 77289, CI 77007</span></p>', 1.87, 4.99, 3.00, 36.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', NULL, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'lapis-delineador-preto-com-apontador', 'Lápis Delineador preto com apontador', '2020-09-22 09:59:10', '2021-09-30 19:44:32', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2113, 'HB8406', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 146, 'Delineador líquido preto', 'Compre Delineador líquido preto Ruby Rose com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Delineador L&iacute;quido - Ruby Rose&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">O Delineador L&iacute;quido Preto da Ruby Rose tem a ponta fininha que &eacute; perfeito para criar tra&ccedil;os finos e delicados ou grossos, como voc&ecirc; preferir! Ele &eacute; bem pigmentado, seca r&aacute;pido e &eacute; resistente a &aacute;gua e o melhor &eacute; que esse produto &eacute; cruelty free.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">Ele &eacute; ideal para voc&ecirc; que ama dar destaque aos olhos e fazer aquele olho gatinho que sempre sonhou.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Imagens meramente ilustrativas.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Visualiza&ccedil;&otilde;es em mobile e desktop podem sofrer altera&ccedil;&otilde;es de cor.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Peso bruto</span>:<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;15g</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Cont&eacute;m:&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>5,8 ml</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Refer&ecirc;ncia&nbsp;</span>HB8406</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;Dimens&otilde;es:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>(L)1,2 X10,6 (A) cm</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;Modo de uso:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">Voc&ecirc; pode usar o delineador l&iacute;quido para desenhar diferentes tra&ccedil;os, fino, grosso, gatinho, o que preferir. Com o delineador l&iacute;quido, fa&ccedil;a um tra&ccedil;o rente aos c&iacute;lios e preencha bem para ficar tudo pretinho. Voc&ecirc; pode aplicar somente o delineador ou por cima de uma sombra e fazer um delineado gatinho.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;Precau&ccedil;&otilde;es:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">- Uso externo.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">- N&atilde;o aplique sobre a pele irritada ou lesionada.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">- Se houver qualquer sinal de irrita&ccedil;&atilde;o, descontinue o uso do produto.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">- Mantenha sempre bem fechado, longe da luz e calor e do alcance de crian&ccedil;as.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" />&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Componentes:</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" />Aqua, Acrylates, Copoylmer, Alcohol, Propylene, Glycol, PEG-6, Caprylic/Capric, Glycerides, Polyethylene, Hydrated Silica, Diazolidinyl&nbsp; Urea, Iodopropynyl, Butylcarbamate, Propylene Glycol</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Pode conter</span>: CI 77266</p>', 8.51, 14.99, 3.00, 24.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', NULL, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'delineador-liquido-preto', 'Delineador líquido preto', '2020-09-22 10:04:33', '2023-12-23 14:24:55', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2120, 'DL04301', 'UN', '0', 90, 188, 142, 'Corretivo Liquido Vegano Cor 01', 'Compre Corretivo Liquido Vegano Cor 01 da Dalla Makeup com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">O Corretivo L&iacute;quido Vegano - Dalla Makeup vai cobrir disfar&ccedil;ar todas aquelas imperfei&ccedil;&otilde;es indesejadas da sua pele, pois oferece alta cobertura, longa dura&ccedil;&atilde;o, acabamento matte e textura super confort&aacute;vel e f&aacute;cil de espalhar e esfumar, sem craquelar, ressecar ou acumular nas linhas de express&atilde;o</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><strong>Dados t&eacute;cnicos</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">*&nbsp;Cont&eacute;m: 3,5 g</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">*&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #fafafa; color: #444444; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\">Composi&ccedil;&atilde;o: Cyclopentasiloxane, Aqua, CI 77891, CI 77492, CI 77492, CI 77491, CI 7499, Glycerin, Lauroyl Lysine, PEG/PPG-20/15 Dimethicone, Nylon-12, Polyglyceryl-4 Isostearate, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Sodium Chloride, Disteardimonium Hectorie, Propylene Carbonate, Dmdm Hydantoin, Aluminium Dimyristate, Triethoxycaprylysane, Disodium N-Stearoyl-L-Glutamate, Phenoxyethanol, Methylparaben, Ethylparaben, Propylparaben, Butylparaben, Isobutylparaben, Tocopheryl Acetate, Parfum, Alpha-Isomethil Ionone, Amyl Cinnamal Butylphenyl, Methylpropional, Citral, Coumarin, H&eacute;xyl Cinnamal, Limonene.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #fafafa; color: #444444; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #fafafa; color: #444444; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><strong>Dica de uso:</strong> Para camulflagem de manchas e marcas e tamb&eacute;m pode ser usado para t&eacute;cnicas de contorno e ilumina&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></p>', 7.50, 14.28, 1.00, 12.00, 0.00, '', '', 0