d; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">Para finalizar, caso voc&ecirc; borre ou cometa alguma falha na aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o a mesma pode ser removida com um lencinho ou cotonete.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">Precau&ccedil;&otilde;es:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Uso externo. N&atilde;o aplique sobre a pele irritada ou lesionada. Se houver qualquer sinal de irrita&ccedil;&atilde;o, descontinue o uso do produto! Mantenha em ambientes com temperatura at&eacute; 40&ordm; C.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>