(2167, 'HB557', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 151, 'Gel Tint Pitaya Pool', 'COmpre Gel Tint Pitaya Pool Ruby Rose com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Gel Tint Pitaya Pool &ndash; Ruby Rose&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">O Gel Tint &eacute; perfeito para real&ccedil;ar a cor natural dos seus l&aacute;bios. S&atilde;o 4 tonalidades para dar aquela apar&ecirc;ncia saud&aacute;vel e corada na make. Ele tem longa dura&ccedil;&atilde;o, &oacute;tima pigmenta&ccedil;&atilde;o que deixa os seus l&aacute;bios coradinhos o dia todo. Ele n&atilde;o escorre e n&atilde;o transfere. Ah, e cada um deles tem um cheirinho delicioso.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">Al&eacute;m disso o Gel Tint &eacute; super vers&aacute;til e pode ser usado nas bochechas como blush l&iacute;quido. &Eacute; s&oacute; aplicar duas a tr&ecirc;s gotinhas e espalhar para ganhar aquele efeito corado de praia.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">Esse Gel Tint ainda possui dois componentes que ir&atilde;o deixar seus l&aacute;bios super hidratados e saud&aacute;veis que &eacute; o &aacute;cido hialur&ocirc;nico e D-Pantenol.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Imagens meramente ilustrativas. Visualiza&ccedil;&otilde;es em mobile e desktop podem sofrer altera&ccedil;&otilde;es de cor.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Cor:&nbsp;</span>Pitaya Pool</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Peso:&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Cont&eacute;m:&nbsp;</span>5,5 ml</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Refer&ecirc;ncia:&nbsp;</span>HB557</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Dimens&otilde;es:&nbsp;</span>(L) 7,5x 1,5 (A) cm</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Modo de uso:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">Aplique o Gel Tint nos l&aacute;bios uniformemente e deixe secar. Para usar como blush aplique algumas gotas sobre as bochechas e d&ecirc; leves batidinhas rapidamente para espalhar.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Precau&ccedil;&otilde;es:</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" />- Uso externo</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">- N&atilde;o aplique sobre a pele irritada ou lesionada</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">- Se houver qualquer sinal de irrita&ccedil;&atilde;o, descontinue o uso do produto</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">- Mantenha sempre bem fechado, longe da luz e calor e do alcance de crian&ccedil;as<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" />&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Componentes:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">Aqua, Sucralose, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Sorbitol, Polyimide-1, Hyaluronic acid, Panthenol,</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, CI 17200,&nbsp; CI 14720, Parfum</p>', 7.58, 14.99, 6.00, 24.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', 0.200, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'gel-tint-pitaya-pool', 'Gel Tint Pitaya Pool', '2020-10-06 20:38:28', '2022-08-27 16:39:02', 16, 11, 6),
(2173, ' HB8516211', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 150, 'Batom Matte Vermelho  211', 'Compre Batom Matte 211 Ruby Rose Com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; width: auto; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d;\"><span style=\"font-size: large; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Use o Batom Matte <strong>8516 211</strong> da Ruby Rose e tenha um acabamento Matte natural!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; width: auto; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: large;\">A linha do Batom Matte <strong>8516 211</strong> tem efeito Semi-Matte e cont&eacute;m mais de 36 cores com alta cobertura para voc&ecirc; expressar de forma aut&ecirc;ntica a sua personalidade, atrav&eacute;s das cores que variam entre neutras e vibrantes!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; width: auto; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><strong>Refer&ecirc;ncia:</strong> HB8516211</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; width: auto; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-