, Dimethicone, Polyglyceryl-4 Isostearate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Propylene Carbonate, Disodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Aluminum Dimyristate, Triethoxycaprylysilane, Polymethyl Methacrylate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Caprylyl Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Parfum, Hexyl Xinnamal.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Poder&aacute; conter: CI 77891, CI 77499, CI 77491, CI 77492.</span></p>', 18.00, 29.68, 1.00, 10.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', NULL, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'meu-blurzinho-querido-cor-03', 'Meu Blurzinho Querido Cor 03', '2020-10-22 17:03:42', '2025-03-08 11:38:45', NULL, NULL, NULL),
