deo player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TCJ4R-BHu64?si=OXJQHqmYgthju1ou\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></div>', 6.89, 13.70, 2.00, 6.00, 6.00, '', '', 0, 'S', 0.100, 'N', 0, NULL, 'S', 'corretivo-serum-hidratante-cor-04-mia-make', 'corretivo-serum-hidratante-cor-04-mia-make', 'Corretivo Sérum Hidratante Cor 04 Mia Make', '2025-07-20 18:08:48', '2025-08-21 15:45:03', 22, 16, 14),
